WEBVTT

00:00:00.403 --> 00:00:02.486 line:88%
Five students. One hackathon.

00:00:02.526 --> 00:00:04.290 line:88%
Let's fix the internship hunt.

00:00:08.094 --> 00:00:12.330 line:88%
Meet Zeto. It helps students seek, and sign, internships.

00:00:13.874 --> 00:00:18.068 line:88%
Search biomedical and engineering placements across Ireland, as you type.

00:00:18.108 --> 00:00:20.284 line:88%
Found one? Track it in one click.

00:00:20.324 --> 00:00:23.356 line:88%
It lands straight in Notion, our live database.

00:00:23.396 --> 00:00:25.998 line:88%
Then move it along. Prep. Submitted.

00:00:26.038 --> 00:00:27.690 line:88%
Interview. Offer!

00:00:27.786 --> 00:00:29.786 line:88%
And Notion doubles as your dashboard.

00:00:29.826 --> 00:00:33.420 line:88%
Every status, every deadline, always in sync.

00:00:33.586 --> 00:00:35.221 line:88%
We built the site in Lovable,

00:00:35.261 --> 00:00:38.450 line:88%
synced it with Notion, and made this video with Claude.

00:00:39.464 --> 00:00:42.020 line:88%
Zeto. From seeking, to signed.
